  176:         # Failure Mode 2):
  177:         #
  178:         # httpx's default connection pool retains the TCP socket between
  179:         # requests for reuse. Middleboxes (NAT, corporate proxy, ISP) and
  180:         # the server's own keepAliveTimeout=75s silently kill that idle
  181:         # socket. When we send the NEXT request to the stale FD, the
